  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is likely a matter of how Youtube videos are rendered from within the SDK, it has nothing to do with lighting or materials used as video backgrounds.Right now, the colours and overall lighting of videos is washed out and too bright as they appear in Vrchat. Some issue with gamma values or possibly dynamic range. I really wish this to be fixed in the next SDK since \"proper\" videos in VRChat are relatively important to have.",
